Z||000006||Seanh||01-17-2001||06:32 PM||||Also, FieroLisa: you dont have to use the image poster to display a picture, if its already uploaded somewhere on the net. Simply put "[IMG]" in front of the link to the picture and "[/IMG]" behind the link. You dont use the " " make either, just put those in there so it would show up. Also dont put any spaces between the link and the img tag. So to show your picture you would put "[!IMG]http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pyranarear.jpg[/IMG!]" You would not put the "!" in the img tag either. <BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.geocities.com/fierolisa/pyranarear.jpg"> ||||reg||1
